     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I get many errors and warnings when installing treeio with biocLite. The first warning is: <div><br></div><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><div><div>** inst</div></div><div><div>Warning in file.create(to[okay]) :</div></div><div><div>  cannot create file &#39;C:/R/win-library/3.3/treeio/extdata/BEAST/beast_mcc.tree&#39;, reason &#39;No such file or directory&#39;</div></div></blockquote><div><br></div><div>And many similar warnings naming all files from the folder extdata. </div><div><div><br></div><div>I don&#39;t know much about the installing process, but could it be a problem that on github the extdata is in the folder treeio/inst/extdata, while it tries to install to treeio/extdata? Or is this a problem of my computer?</div></div></div>"
